<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ status_code }} - Fidelissimo</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="{{ asset('favicon/favicon.ico') }}">
    <style>
        :root {
            --brand-blue: #163a70;
            --brand-blue-2: #214995;
            --brand-gold: #fbbb3b;
            --ink: #1f2937;
            --muted: #6b7280;
            --paper: #ffffff;
            --bg-a: #f4efe2;
            --bg-b: #eef2ff;
            --bg-c: #e5e7eb;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background:
                radial-gradient(1100px 480px at -5% -10%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.20), transparent 65%),
                radial-gradient(900px 460px at 105% 115%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.26), transparent 60%),
                linear-gradient(165deg, var(--bg-a) 0%, var(--bg-b) 48%, var(--bg-c) 100%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .error-shell {
            width: min(980px, 100%);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
            background: var(--paper);
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 18px 65px rgba(22, 58, 112, 0.22);
        }

        .left {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--brand-blue) 0%, var(--brand-blue-2) 60%, #0f766e 100%);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 36px 28px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .left::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: auto -30% -25% auto;
            width: 240px;
            height: 240px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(251, 187, 59, 0.22);
            filter: blur(1px);
        }

        .code {
            font-size: 72px;
            line-height: 1;
            margin: 12px 0;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .left p {
            margin: 0;
            opacity: 0.9;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }

        .right {
            padding: 36px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: #fef3c7;
            color: #92400e;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            color: var(--brand-blue);
            font-size: 32px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .desc {
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 56ch;
        }

        .stack {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            list-style: none;
            display: grid;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .stack li {
            border-left: 4px solid rgba(33, 73, 149, 0.22);
            padding: 8px 12px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            color: #374151;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--brand-gold);
            color: #1b2e56;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            border-color: #cbd5e1;
            color: #334155;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .meta {
            margin-top: 16px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .error-shell {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .left,
            .right {
                padding: 28px 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    {% set statusPrefix = status_code // 100 %}
    {% set defaultBadge = statusPrefix == 5 ? 'Incident serveur' : (statusPrefix == 4 ? 'Action impossible' : (statusPrefix == 3 ? 'Redirection' : 'Information')) %}
    {% set defaultTitle = statusPrefix == 5 ? 'Oups, une erreur technique est survenue' : (statusPrefix == 4 ? 'La page demandée est indisponible' : (statusPrefix == 3 ? 'Cette ressource a changé d’adresse' : 'Réponse système')) %}
    {% set defaultMessage = statusPrefix == 5
        ? 'Nos équipes ont été notifiées. Tu peux réessayer dans un instant.'
        : (statusPrefix == 4
            ? 'Vérifie l’URL ou retourne sur une page connue.'
            : (statusPrefix == 3
                ? 'Le navigateur attend une redirection. Tu peux revenir à l’accueil.'
                : 'Le serveur a retourné une réponse inattendue.')) %}
    {% set title = error_title|default(defaultTitle) %}
    {% set message = error_message|default(defaultMessage) %}
    {% set badgeText = error_badge|default(defaultBadge) %}

    <section class="error-shell" role="alert" aria-live="assertive">
        <aside class="left">
            <img src="{{ asset('image/logo.png') }}" alt="Logo Fidelissimo" width="88">
            <div class="code">{{ status_code }}</div>
            <p>{{ status_text ?: 'Erreur' }}</p>
        </aside>
        <div class="right">
            <span class="badge">{{ badgeText }}</span>
            <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
            <p class="desc">{{ message }}</p>

            <ul class="stack">
                <li>Retourne au tableau de bord pour reprendre ton flux.</li>
                <li>Recharge la page après quelques secondes.</li>
                <li>Si ça persiste, contacte le support Fidelissimo.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="actions">
                <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">Retour au dashboard</a>
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">Accueil</a>
            </div>
            <div class="meta">Code {{ status_code }} • Fidelissimo</div>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
